WEBVTT

00:00:02.005 --> 00:00:05.805
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:10.077
Delivers this message

00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:19.080
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:20.690
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:28.798
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.093
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:36.602
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:40.969
But please don't look back

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.137
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:49.444
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:53.155
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:57.325
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:01.390
Delivers this message

00:01:01.831 --> 00:01:10.000
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.373 --> 00:01:18.576
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:28.686
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:31.928 --> 00:01:35.523
You never called me by
my real name, not even once.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.425
I love you. And your playing the erhu...

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.038
...making tea for me...

00:01:44.807 --> 00:01:46.775
...everything about you.

00:02:00.656 --> 00:02:05.616
Tears From Eyes and
Rain From Heaven

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:10.065
The days passed on, and
autumn was about to end.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:12.694
However the duties of
Shurei and Eigetsu...

00:02:12.769 --> 00:02:14.600
...who had just taken on
their assignment...

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:18.162
...as the governors of Sa Province,
had only just begun.

00:02:20.977 --> 00:02:23.309
Just like we thought, there
isn't anything worth much here.

00:02:23.379 --> 00:02:26.246
I can understand very
well now why Sa Province...

00:02:26.649 --> 00:02:29.243
...had been abandoned for such a
long time. How are the crops?

00:02:30.052 --> 00:02:32.111
Not too good, due to
the barren land.

00:02:32.321 --> 00:02:34.789
On top of that, the Sa Clan's autocratic
dictatorship lasted so long...

00:02:34.857 --> 00:02:37.382
...that there are no existing
relations with other provinces.

00:02:37.994 --> 00:02:40.019
And since the province is in a sense
closed off from the outside world...

00:02:40.096 --> 00:02:42.064
...peddlers don't come here
from other territories.

00:02:42.131 --> 00:02:43.826
How about the mountains?

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.368
Were there any ores from which we
can extract iron, gold, or silver?

00:02:46.769 --> 00:02:49.761
There are all kinds of places that
haven't even been checked out yet.

00:02:50.339 --> 00:02:52.705
But if we're basing our
infrastructure off an industry...

00:02:52.775 --> 00:02:55.801
...we should pick something like
agriculture that produces...

00:02:56.078 --> 00:02:58.376
...goods every year and will still be
around a hundred years from now.

00:02:59.415 --> 00:03:01.815
A hundred years
from now... you say...!

00:03:02.985 --> 00:03:05.044
That's why we have to
think hard about it.

00:03:08.825 --> 00:03:11.988
Wow! The morning sky
is beautiful, isn't it?

00:03:13.262 --> 00:03:16.288
Speaking of which,
they haven't found Mr. Ryuren.

00:03:17.066 --> 00:03:21.366
You're right. We did drive him away
quite harshly that last time, after all.

00:03:22.338 --> 00:03:24.499
I've watched the daybreak
countless times...

00:03:24.574 --> 00:03:27.566
...but it must be lonely
watching it all by himself.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.008
Oh? So you've watched
it countless times.

00:03:32.482 --> 00:03:35.883
So, are you planning on making a habit
of watching the sunrise from now on?

00:03:36.886 --> 00:03:40.151
No, it's not like we pulled another
all-nighter or anything.

00:03:40.556 --> 00:03:42.922
You said you'd definitely
go home last night.

00:03:42.992 --> 00:03:46.393
That's why Seiran, Yushun
and I did other work.

00:03:46.996 --> 00:03:49.396
You two should be sleeping at
the governor's residence...

00:03:50.099 --> 00:03:53.227
...not here, surrounded by books and
creating bags under your eyes.

00:03:55.872 --> 00:03:57.840
Come on. You're imagining things.

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:01.667
Imagining things?
Hey, what do you think?

00:04:04.046 --> 00:04:05.240
S-Seiran.

00:04:05.982 --> 00:04:07.142
Both of you, come here.

00:04:07.717 --> 00:04:10.652
I shall teach you two a lesson,
something I haven't done in some time.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.347
All right.

00:04:16.926 --> 00:04:19.394
I'm really happy that you're both
so enthusiastic about your work...

00:04:19.462 --> 00:04:21.930
...but if you ruin your health
by pushing yourself too much...

00:04:21.998 --> 00:04:24.398
...that will not do anyone
any good, will it?

00:04:25.334 --> 00:04:28.826
Taking regular breaks and maintaining
your health while taking on...

00:04:29.238 --> 00:04:31.706
...your duties is also a very important
part of the governor's responsibilities.

00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:32.769
Yes.

00:04:32.842 --> 00:04:33.501
I'm sorry.

00:04:35.111 --> 00:04:37.511
Well, they'll probably still force
themselves for some time to come...

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.912
...even with that lecture.

00:04:39.982 --> 00:04:40.539
Yeah.

00:04:41.584 --> 00:04:44.052
As long as she's having
trouble forgetting about him.

00:04:47.089 --> 00:04:48.351
The palace celebration?

00:04:48.424 --> 00:04:49.322
When the new year arrives...

00:04:49.392 --> 00:04:51.724
...representatives from the
Seven Colored Clans of course...

00:04:51.794 --> 00:04:53.762
...and officials from each
province head to Kiyo...

00:04:53.829 --> 00:04:55.763
...and extend their
greetings to the king.

00:04:57.233 --> 00:04:59.360
The king... to Ryuki?

00:04:59.869 --> 00:05:00.961
Well...

00:05:01.037 --> 00:05:03.005
It's a once-a-year opportunity...

00:05:03.072 --> 00:05:05.302
...for important people across
the country to gather together...

00:05:05.374 --> 00:05:07.672
...so there's a considerable
amount of diplomatic exchange...

00:05:07.743 --> 00:05:09.677
...going on behind the scenes.

00:05:09.745 --> 00:05:11.337
Diplomatic exchange?

00:05:11.881 --> 00:05:14.008
It's not an exaggeration to say that...

00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:16.643
...what happens around the time of the
palace celebration has a direct...

00:05:16.719 --> 00:05:18.687
...influence on practically everything
that's decided throughout the year...

00:05:18.754 --> 00:05:20.381
...from personnel to budget issues.

00:05:20.489 --> 00:05:25.119
So it's not as easy as casually greeting
people and then returning here.

00:05:26.162 --> 00:05:28.130
So, which of you will go?

00:05:28.798 --> 00:05:31.289
Since there is quite a bit of
work that needs to be done here...

00:05:31.867 --> 00:05:35.064
...either Governor Hong or
Governor To should stay behind.

00:05:35.972 --> 00:05:39.601
You should go, Shurei. I'm sure
that Mr. Shoka will be delighted.

00:05:41.477 --> 00:05:43.240
That's not the only reason.

00:05:43.312 --> 00:05:44.904
You have more weapons
at your disposal...

00:05:44.981 --> 00:05:46.778
...when it comes to
diplomatic maneuvers.

00:05:47.483 --> 00:05:50.714
Although I may be insulting
you by pointing it out.

00:05:53.356 --> 00:05:55.551
Very well. I'll go.

00:05:58.527 --> 00:06:00.222
I will accompany you,
along with Seiran...

00:06:00.296 --> 00:06:02.730
...Merchants Guild representative
Miss Rin Sai and Lord Kokujun...

00:06:02.798 --> 00:06:06.700
...who will be offering
his greetings as Sa Clan's head.

00:06:16.312 --> 00:06:18.337
I'm happy to be able to see Father...

00:06:19.015 --> 00:06:21.483
...but for me to meet Ryuki
while feeling this way...!

00:06:23.753 --> 00:06:26.119
Princess. What's wrong?

00:06:28.524 --> 00:06:29.582
It's nothing.

00:06:30.126 --> 00:06:31.525
That's obviously not true.

00:06:32.128 --> 00:06:33.425
I just feel a little uneasy.

00:06:33.496 --> 00:06:36.329
You're not going to the palace
celebration, are you, Ensei?

00:06:37.466 --> 00:06:41.300
I've been depending on you so much,
without even realizing it.

00:06:42.171 --> 00:06:44.139
It makes me very happy to hear that.

00:06:45.341 --> 00:06:47.809
Are you that lonely when
you're separated from me?

00:06:47.877 --> 00:06:48.844
Yes.

00:06:50.579 --> 00:06:51.546
But this time around...

00:06:51.614 --> 00:06:54.174
...I'll do my best to get by without
you around, Ensei. Good night.

00:06:55.384 --> 00:06:57.352
Wait a minute.

00:06:57.853 --> 00:07:00.720
I'll make you some
delicious tea right now.

00:07:05.061 --> 00:07:06.028
Here.

00:07:06.662 --> 00:07:07.287
Thank you.

00:07:07.997 --> 00:07:10.898
But this residence where the
governors should be living...

00:07:11.033 --> 00:07:13.001
...has become more like a library.

00:07:13.436 --> 00:07:15.461
I feel more at ease this way.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:22.339
Ensei, do I look depressed enough
to prompt you to make me some tea?

00:07:22.878 --> 00:07:25.244
No, I'm just worried
about you anyway.

00:07:26.849 --> 00:07:28.817
It appears that they've finished...

00:07:28.984 --> 00:07:31.452
...clearing away the debris of
the building they brought down.

00:07:31.787 --> 00:07:33.880
That trap that collapses
the whole building...

00:07:33.956 --> 00:07:35.890
...when you apply a certain weight?

00:07:36.425 --> 00:07:38.916
Chusho was pretty clever
to think of such a thing.

00:07:39.562 --> 00:07:41.154
They found large quantities of...

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.027
...gunpowder and jars of oil
underneath the floor.

00:07:43.966 --> 00:07:46.434
But I'm glad they finished clearing
everything without incident.

00:07:48.137 --> 00:07:50.901
So it's just Saku that they
couldn't find right to the end.

00:07:53.042 --> 00:07:57.672
That's right. He would cause me
trouble, right to his very last moment.

00:07:59.749 --> 00:08:02.217
That man was involved
in many dreadful deeds...

00:08:03.352 --> 00:08:06.321
...but he never once showed an
expression of cruelty to me.

00:08:07.022 --> 00:08:08.990
He never once forced
me to do anything.

00:08:09.658 --> 00:08:13.458
"Play the erhu for me", "Brew some
tea for me", "Do up my hair for me".

00:08:14.263 --> 00:08:16.754
Those were the only things
that man asked of me.

00:08:20.503 --> 00:08:22.903
I couldn't bring myself to hate him.

00:08:23.806 --> 00:08:25.967
That's quite all right,
for you, Princess.

00:08:26.675 --> 00:08:27.642
You're the first and only person...

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.406
...Saku tried to get to like him,
since he was born.

00:08:31.347 --> 00:08:33.975
He showed only his prettiest
colors to just you.

00:08:34.517 --> 00:08:36.985
There's no way you could hate him,
nor is there any need for you to.

00:08:40.356 --> 00:08:42.654
But you know, I wasn't fair to him.

00:08:43.526 --> 00:08:44.550
I was charmed by that man...

00:08:44.627 --> 00:08:48.256
...which kept me from telling him
properly until the end.

00:08:49.431 --> 00:08:50.295
Telling him what?

00:08:50.499 --> 00:08:52.330
That "I can't be with you".

00:08:53.636 --> 00:08:55.604
It's nothing to laugh about!

00:08:56.238 --> 00:09:00.004
It's just... Those words do not at
all match that guy's personality.

00:09:00.609 --> 00:09:04.067
You're right. Even if I did say that to
him, he'd just play it off as a joke.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.915
But then... I should've
said it over and over.

00:09:09.051 --> 00:09:11.019
Until the words reached his heart.

00:09:17.293 --> 00:09:19.193
I figured you might be here.

00:09:19.261 --> 00:09:19.590
Yes.

00:09:20.296 --> 00:09:23.094
I'm all right. Don't worry about me.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.838
I wasn't able to do anything
about it either, Seiran.

00:09:32.541 --> 00:09:35.669
On the contrary, we're the ones
who are being worried over.

00:09:36.111 --> 00:09:37.237
You're pathetic.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:38.840
You too.

00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:44.349
That's because you and I were too
deeply involved in this latest incident.

00:09:45.087 --> 00:09:47.055
Someone died right
before her eyes.

00:09:47.456 --> 00:09:49.924
There's no way that our kind
Princess would not be upset.

00:09:50.526 --> 00:09:54.360
Damn you, Saku. Causing trouble
right to the very bitter end.

00:09:57.299 --> 00:10:01.565
In her state, only a third party or
Master Shoka could make a difference.

00:10:12.781 --> 00:10:14.772
Darn, this is the worst.

00:10:23.559 --> 00:10:25.823
No... I mustn't cry.

00:10:43.946 --> 00:10:44.913
You're supposed to say...

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:47.813
..."Please excuse me" when
visiting someone's home...

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:50.074
...Ryuren!

00:10:50.886 --> 00:10:53.878
Add more elegance to the
myriad aspects of your life...

00:10:54.556 --> 00:10:56.581
...and your life will be more fulfilled.

00:10:57.126 --> 00:10:59.094
It's already past midnight.

00:10:59.461 --> 00:11:03.090
Next time, make sure you're
here before dusk. All right?

00:11:03.866 --> 00:11:07.563
Sure. But for dinner, I would fancy
some rice porridge with mushrooms.

00:11:08.203 --> 00:11:12.606
I got it, now get inside quick.
The nights have gotten a lot colder.

00:11:19.715 --> 00:11:22.047
Hey, what happened to your feathers?

00:11:22.685 --> 00:11:23.709
While on my travels...

00:11:23.786 --> 00:11:27.017
...I reencountered two young men
who yearned for my feathers...

00:11:27.256 --> 00:11:29.224
...so I traded them for some things.

00:11:30.626 --> 00:11:32.321
I-It couldn't be...!

00:11:39.368 --> 00:11:43.361
I'm sorry that I chased you off the
last time. I said some harsh things.

00:11:47.309 --> 00:11:49.277
Wait!

00:11:49.645 --> 00:11:52.113
Nobody can speculate what goes
on in other people's hearts.

00:11:53.315 --> 00:11:55.875
It's also difficult to predict where
following the heart will lead you.

00:11:57.319 --> 00:11:59.844
Ever since Sakujun Sa's
rampage stopped...

00:12:00.189 --> 00:12:02.657
...casualties have been
reduced to a minimum.

00:12:02.758 --> 00:12:05.226
You were the only one that
succeeded in doing that.

00:12:05.761 --> 00:12:07.729
It was something
that only you could do.

00:12:09.365 --> 00:12:13.324
So, what's your point?
I killed that man.

00:12:15.004 --> 00:12:18.371
Yes. While he chose death
for his self-satisfaction...

00:12:19.074 --> 00:12:21.542
...you were the one who made
him select that option.

00:12:21.844 --> 00:12:23.835
He was a man who
was merely there.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:25.677
But he developed an interest in life...

00:12:25.748 --> 00:12:27.716
...to the extent of making a
choice between life and death.

00:12:28.617 --> 00:12:30.949
You were the only one who
could save Sakujun Sa...

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.288
...and the only one
who could kill him.

00:12:33.522 --> 00:12:37.151
So you're the only one in this
world who can cry for his sake.

00:12:38.761 --> 00:12:41.787
The funeral rites are finished and most
of the judgments have been laid down.

00:12:42.631 --> 00:12:46.362
All that remains
for you to do, is to cry.

00:12:47.369 --> 00:12:49.337
If it's all right for me to cry, then I'll cry.

00:12:49.671 --> 00:12:52.469
You'd better be ready for the
clothes you're wearing to be ruined.

00:12:52.541 --> 00:12:55.339
If not, then please tell me how
much your clothes cost in total.

00:12:56.011 --> 00:12:58.377
If I hear that, it should be
enough to hold back my tears.

00:12:59.048 --> 00:13:01.710
If you'd like, I'll play you
the Tragic Song of the Century.

00:13:02.918 --> 00:13:05.716
I'm gonna cry,
even without the flute!

00:13:15.731 --> 00:13:18.495
"Tears from eyes and rain
from heaven."

00:13:18.567 --> 00:13:20.797
That is part of the natural
order of things.

00:13:22.271 --> 00:13:24.205
And just as the blue sky
eventually peeks through the clouds...

00:13:24.273 --> 00:13:25.205
...tears will also dry.

00:13:28.043 --> 00:13:33.003
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:39.021 --> 00:13:42.980
I was thinking. Did you
come here to cheer me up?

00:13:43.859 --> 00:13:46.657
Kokujun was telling me that
you're always cheerful.

00:13:47.396 --> 00:13:49.364
But you cannot fool a kindred spirit.

00:13:50.365 --> 00:13:52.356
Huh? You've met Kokujun?

00:13:52.801 --> 00:13:56.032
Since I'm staying at his place,
I see him every day.

00:13:57.706 --> 00:13:59.674
How did something
like that happen?!

00:14:00.642 --> 00:14:03.167
While I was walking the city,
he called on me.

00:14:03.779 --> 00:14:05.747
Please excuse me
for my abruptness...

00:14:06.014 --> 00:14:08.414
...but I would like you to
choose my wardrobe for me.

00:14:08.484 --> 00:14:12.045
I will be going to the palace celebration
but I have no idea what I should wear.

00:14:12.688 --> 00:14:14.590
I'm not too sure about what's in
fashion in Kiyo and what's not.

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:15.324
Serious

00:14:15.324 --> 00:14:17.893
Serious
If it's all right with you, could you
please stay at my home...

00:14:17.893 --> 00:14:17.926
Serious

00:14:17.926 --> 00:14:19.826
Serious
...and kindly offer me some
of your advice?

00:14:20.429 --> 00:14:23.227
No matter how you look at it, he's
selected the wrong person for the job.

00:14:23.765 --> 00:14:28.225
Being the same age, I could not
turn him down when he insisted.

00:14:29.538 --> 00:14:31.506
You're the same age as Kokujun?

00:14:31.773 --> 00:14:36.870
On top of that, he and his new
bride applauded my flute playing.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.505
Kokujun might become
quite an important person.

00:14:42.751 --> 00:14:45.219
Strangely, you have a way of
opening the path for people.

00:14:45.487 --> 00:14:47.455
For me to have come here...

00:14:47.623 --> 00:14:49.784
...and for Kokujun to become
the head of the Sa Clan...

00:14:49.858 --> 00:14:51.951
...and for Ensei to
take the basic exams...

00:14:52.027 --> 00:14:53.927
...and for the provincial government
to become as stable as it is now.

00:14:53.996 --> 00:14:56.464
Your actions have a lot to
do with each of these things.

00:14:57.933 --> 00:15:00.959
And strangely, you seem to
know a lot about everything.

00:15:03.939 --> 00:15:06.567
That's what it means to
have the name "Ryuren Ran".

00:15:12.347 --> 00:15:14.110
I'll have to excuse myself.

00:15:14.183 --> 00:15:17.812
Being in a lady's bedroom at midnight
might lead to a bad reputation.

00:15:25.827 --> 00:15:27.795
All right! I've gotta keep at it!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.934
If agriculture and forestry won't work...

00:15:34.002 --> 00:15:36.163
...and the city cannot become
a commercial center...

00:15:36.238 --> 00:15:39.401
...what could be
Sa Province's main industry?

00:15:41.977 --> 00:15:43.638
What is it, Eigetsu?

00:15:43.712 --> 00:15:48.877
Ah, well... I was just thinking
you seem somewhat refreshed.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.188
Maybe it's because
I cried my eyes out.

00:15:54.389 --> 00:15:57.825
I'm sorry to have worried you.
But I'm fine now.

00:15:58.594 --> 00:16:03.258
As long as I'm alive, I'll do
what I can, the best that I can.

00:16:05.033 --> 00:16:09.026
Right. As long as we're alive,
we'll do the best we can.

00:16:10.138 --> 00:16:13.665
But even so, when it comes to
how to create new industries...

00:16:14.176 --> 00:16:16.474
...there's a limit to what we
can come up with on our own.

00:16:16.845 --> 00:16:21.248
That's true. We'll have to ask for the
opinions of specialists in various fields.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:23.112
For example?

00:16:23.185 --> 00:16:26.245
- Applied arts and fine arts...
...pharmacy and medicine...!

00:16:27.256 --> 00:16:29.986
Gather such specialists
together and...!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:35.927
Eigetsu!

00:16:35.998 --> 00:16:38.796
That's it! There's that possibility!

00:16:38.867 --> 00:16:39.526
Right!

00:16:40.068 --> 00:16:42.036
In any case, let's work on that idea.

00:17:02.958 --> 00:17:05.518
Do you two plan on
watching the sunrise again?

00:17:07.996 --> 00:17:11.090
Ensei. We were just thinking
of heading home shortly.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.165
What's that you have?

00:17:13.235 --> 00:17:15.499
Oh... that's... It's not finished yet!

00:17:16.071 --> 00:17:18.039
Perfect timing! Yushun!

00:17:19.207 --> 00:17:21.175
Yes? What is it?

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.913
Ensei. Please gather all of
the provincial officials here.

00:17:29.484 --> 00:17:32.920
Also, please invite Miss Rin Sai
as well. As for the two of you...

00:17:33.689 --> 00:17:36.954
Please collect documents relating to
this matter as quickly as possible.

00:17:40.862 --> 00:17:43.353
Now, I would like you two to
provide us with an explanation.

00:17:44.132 --> 00:17:46.100
The two of us have
been thinking about...

00:17:46.168 --> 00:17:48.636
...how we can bring all of Sa Province
up from its current depression.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:50.938
Not only must we inherit the work...

00:17:51.006 --> 00:17:53.497
...that Mr. Ensei and Mr. Yushun
have maintained until now...

00:17:53.575 --> 00:17:56.567
...it is our responsibility to take
the province to the next level.

00:17:56.912 --> 00:17:58.777
The next level, huh?

00:17:58.847 --> 00:18:00.815
And that's what this
plan is all about.

00:18:01.283 --> 00:18:03.751
We will create a research
institution in Sa Province.

00:18:04.119 --> 00:18:06.587
We'd like to make Sa Province
a center for academic research.

00:18:07.622 --> 00:18:09.988
We figured this is the path that will
not only lead Sa Province to prosperity...

00:18:10.058 --> 00:18:11.116
...but give the province a future...

00:18:11.193 --> 00:18:12.421
...that will still be in place a
hundred years from now.

00:18:16.798 --> 00:18:18.766
That's interesting.

00:18:20.302 --> 00:18:22.270
The plan is still full
of holes, of course...

00:18:22.337 --> 00:18:24.134
...but it's definitely worth
discussing further.

00:18:25.474 --> 00:18:27.442
You're right about that.

00:18:28.377 --> 00:18:30.368
It is quite an
interesting plan, indeed.

00:18:32.414 --> 00:18:34.041
Miss Rin Sai.

00:18:34.116 --> 00:18:37.483
However, it's also a far-reaching
plan that would require...

00:18:37.552 --> 00:18:41.044
...considerable funds significant land
and many talented people to complete.

00:18:41.957 --> 00:18:44.619
We invited you with the intention
of asking the Merchants Guild...

00:18:44.693 --> 00:18:47.628
...for your cooperation in areas
such as financial assistance.

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.495
I would love to help you...

00:18:50.565 --> 00:18:53.625
...but I cannot support a plan that
may be aborted while in progress.

00:18:54.236 --> 00:18:56.101
As chief representative
of the Merchants Guild...

00:18:56.171 --> 00:18:58.571
...I cannot give my assent so readily.

00:18:58.907 --> 00:19:00.238
Elder sister!

00:19:05.313 --> 00:19:09.409
Having said that, I'm touched by the
spirit the two governors have shown...

00:19:09.851 --> 00:19:12.820
...thinking about Sa Province one
hundred years into the future.

00:19:13.388 --> 00:19:16.448
We too shall look further into this plan
with every intention of making it work.

00:19:18.026 --> 00:19:20.961
Then we shall consider this
proposal thoroughly, and...!

00:19:21.029 --> 00:19:22.997
Let us reconvene in one month.

00:19:23.899 --> 00:19:25.423
In one month?

00:19:25.967 --> 00:19:28.561
This is an important matter
for Sa Province's future.

00:19:29.171 --> 00:19:31.139
Let's do our best, everyone.

00:19:31.339 --> 00:19:34.797
In other words, it should be ready
by the new year. Right. Yushun?

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.335
For the new year?
You mean the celebration?

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:43.149
Right. We can present the matter
officially during the palace celebration.

00:19:48.423 --> 00:19:51.950
I understand. I'll do everything
I can while I'm there.

00:20:06.508 --> 00:20:09.477
So you're admiring the sunset instead
of the sunrise today, are you?

00:20:10.378 --> 00:20:11.345
Ensei.

00:20:15.917 --> 00:20:17.885
You're amazing, Princess.

00:20:18.019 --> 00:20:20.487
You thought up something
like that out of the blue.

00:20:22.023 --> 00:20:23.991
I must go forward.

00:20:25.961 --> 00:20:29.692
I realized that the reason I
couldn't take that man's hand...

00:20:30.165 --> 00:20:32.633
...was because I want to
keep moving forward.

00:20:33.802 --> 00:20:38.432
I'm greedy. I can't forsake the
things that are important to me...

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.632
...and the things that I've cultivated.

00:20:40.709 --> 00:20:43.177
I can't trade away all the
feelings that I hold in my heart...

00:20:43.245 --> 00:20:47.375
...in exchange for living my
life for that man's sake.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.216
If I were able to throw
it all away that easily...

00:20:51.286 --> 00:20:53.754
...I wouldn't have taken the National
Examinations in the first place.

00:20:54.422 --> 00:20:56.890
I wanted to become a
government official for so long.

00:20:56.992 --> 00:20:59.460
I had vaguely thought that
I would become an official...

00:20:59.694 --> 00:21:03.323
...and work diligently to help
keep the country from collapsing.

00:21:04.332 --> 00:21:05.890
But my thoughts are different now.

00:21:05.967 --> 00:21:07.935
I want to become a
government official...

00:21:08.003 --> 00:21:10.471
...who will be acknowledged by
the people whom I respect.

00:21:11.072 --> 00:21:14.530
I want to be an official who is capable
of helping others, such as you, Ensei.

00:21:15.544 --> 00:21:18.035
I want to move much further up.

00:21:22.651 --> 00:21:24.619
That's an astounding confession.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.250
It's unfair to use such a
surprise tactic, Princess.

00:21:29.925 --> 00:21:32.393
Don't be in such a hurry
to become an adult.

00:21:32.827 --> 00:21:36.695
But I intend to. I fully understand
now that I can't remain a child.

00:21:37.899 --> 00:21:39.867
I won't make the same
mistake again.

00:21:40.669 --> 00:21:43.137
And I'll give everything lots and
lots of thought so it doesn't happen.

00:21:44.739 --> 00:21:47.708
Ensei, I can do it.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.318
So, we shall be going now.

00:21:57.419 --> 00:21:59.387
Right. Take care of yourself.

00:22:00.288 --> 00:22:02.256
Oh? Are you heading back?

00:22:04.025 --> 00:22:05.993
What are you smirking for?

00:22:06.328 --> 00:22:08.694
You see. I was just thinking
how fortunate I was...

00:22:08.763 --> 00:22:09.821
...to have such a great boss.

00:22:10.131 --> 00:22:13.100
Thinking ahead
hundred years down the road.

00:22:14.002 --> 00:22:15.970
That's not a simple thing to say.

00:22:16.204 --> 00:22:19.435
It's the way a prime minister
overlooking a country thinks.

00:22:20.041 --> 00:22:21.201
Lieutenant Governor Ro.

00:22:21.276 --> 00:22:25.508
We may be assisting in the first steps
of two soon-to-be legendary officials...

00:22:25.914 --> 00:22:28.212
...who will have their names
etched in history books.

00:22:28.283 --> 00:22:30.217
It's giving me chills.

00:22:31.219 --> 00:22:33.687
Well, the real battle will be
during the palace celebration.

00:22:40.462 --> 00:22:42.726
- Shurei.
- What is it?

00:22:42.797 --> 00:22:44.765
I'm glad that we're in this together.

00:22:45.166 --> 00:22:48.033
That I could serve as a government
official in Sa Province with you.

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:53.740
I feel the same way.

00:22:55.276 --> 00:22:57.244
I brought you a midnight snack.

00:22:57.779 --> 00:23:00.714
Please do enjoy it, Lady Shurei.

00:23:01.149 --> 00:23:04.243
Thank you. Oh, it's meatball soup!

00:23:07.222 --> 00:23:10.487
It's really delicious!
Not only is the soup good...

00:23:10.725 --> 00:23:13.091
...but so is the texture of the
meatballs that soak it up.

00:23:13.194 --> 00:23:15.162
I give it a perfect score! Right?!

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:18.688
Yes, I agree! This is my favorite.

00:23:18.967 --> 00:23:21.197
I made it especially for Lady Shurei!

00:23:21.603 --> 00:23:24.367
Yes, but it truly is
delicious just the same.

00:23:30.578 --> 00:23:35.675
You've always led a very carefree
life and right now

00:23:35.817 --> 00:23:42.381
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:47.553
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.662 --> 00:23:52.656
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.735 --> 00:23:58.195
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.741 --> 00:24:04.872
You are just like me

00:24:05.613 --> 00:24:10.141
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.218 --> 00:24:16.123
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.092 --> 00:24:22.894
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.997 --> 00:24:27.866
I will always think of you

00:24:29.003 --> 00:24:41.677
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:45.620
Next Episode

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:47.722
Next Episode
We're heading for Kiyo to attend...

00:24:47.722 --> 00:24:47.956
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today

00:24:47.956 --> 00:24:49.491
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today
...the New Year's
palace celebration.

00:24:49.491 --> 00:24:49.524
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today

00:24:49.524 --> 00:24:52.026
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today
Eigetsu, Ensei, please
look after Sa Province.

00:24:52.026 --> 00:24:52.660
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today

00:24:52.660 --> 00:24:54.218
Next Episode
There is No Today After Today
I'll be seeing you soon, Father...

00:24:54.295 --> 00:24:56.855
...Koyu, General Ran! An...!
